/E (Cola-Coka leads brand awareness at 14.04%, followed by Bepsi \(11.76%\) and Gangster \(10.43%\). CodeX currently sits at 5.25%, 6th of 7 tracked brands, ahead of only the aggregated "Others" category. This positions CodeX as an emerging entrant still building category recognition, with a meaningful awareness gap to close against the three established leaders.)
