/E (Cola-Coka and Bepsi lead adoption through strong reputation and taste, while CodeX lags on effectiveness and visibility. The primary barriers to CodeX trial are health concerns, limited availability, and low unaided familiarity, with CodeX disproportionately affected relative to competitors, pointing to accessibility and perception as the two highest-leverage areas for intervention.)
