/E (CodeX currently holds 5.25% brand awareness, ranking 6th of 7 tracked brands. This positions CodeX as an early-stage entrant still building basic category recognition, with more than 2.5x the awareness gap to close against the leading brand alone. Awareness is not evenly distributed geographically: CodeX's recognition peaks in Bangalore and Hyderabad, while Cola-Coka dominates in Mumbai and Delhi, and Bepsi leads in Kolkata. This suggests CodeX's current footprint is concentrated rather than national)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
