/P 210 0 R
/E (Across all brands, "Effective" and "Not sure" are the two largest response categories, with "Healthy" and "Dangerous" both trailing, consumers judge energy drinks primarily on functional performance, not health framing. For CodeX, the "Not sure" segment is comparable in size to its "Effective" segment, suggesting many respondents are genuinely undecided rather than actively distrustful. Undecided is a far more addressable barrier than distrust, it's a familiarity gap, not a reputation problem.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
