/P 211 0 R
/E (Trial is being held back by three factors: health concerns, limited local availability, and low interest in the category overall. Health concerns carry the most weight and, notably, they're strongest in Bangalore, Hyderabad, and Mumbai, the exact cities where CodeX's awareness is already highest. That overlap matters: simply pushing more people to hear about CodeX in these markets won't convert them if the underlying health hesitation isn't addressed first.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
