/Title (CodeX's equity is anchored in brand reputation and taste, the two factors that most influence buyers who've already chosen the brand, with availability playing a supporting role, particularly in larger metro markets. This reinforces where CodeX should double down: reputation and taste are working, and the growth constraint lies elsewhere, as the barriers below make clear.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1271 0 R
>>
endobj
1277 0 obj
<<
/Title (Healthier alternatives \(low-calorie/sugar-free\) are a rising priority, showing a shift to health-conscious choices.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1261 0 R
/Prev 1273 0 R
/Next 1278 0 R
>>
