1278 0 obj
<<
/Title (Wider range of flavors is also valued, especially among younger consumers seeking variety.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1261 0 R
/Prev 1277 0 R
/Next 1274 0 R
>>
endobj
1279 0 obj
<<
/Title (The strongest cross-brand signal is a consumer shift toward health-conscious choices: reduced sugar, natural ingredients, and healthier alternatives are valued across every brand studied, most strongly for Cola-Coka and Bepsi. For CodeX, aligning product development with this trend, rather than competing on flavor variety alone, offers the most direct path to closing the gap with category leaders.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1274 0 R
>>
